OL,3,AHealey pledges growth but acknowledges
OL,4,Ahigh government borrowing costs in
OL,5,Afirst speech as chancellor
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring the speech, Healey announces
OL,8,Fplans to allocate #150m to fast-growing
OL,9,Ffirms in the north of England and to
OL,10,Fcreate the "northern 500", bringing
OL,11,Ftogether "the North's most ambitious
OL,12,Fmid-sized businesses" in a group led by
OL,13,Fmayors
OL,15,FHe also acknowledges that government
OL,16,Fborrowing costs are at "historic
OL,17,Fhighs", blaming "high borrowing and low
OL,18,Fgrowth" which he says has allowed
OL,19,Fnational debt to rise to almost 100% of
OL,20,FGDP
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
